<title>GERMANY: German stock exchange says IBIS trade interrupted.</title>
<headline>German stock exchange says IBIS trade interrupted.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Deutsche Boerse German stock exchange said on Monday its IBIS electronic share dealing systems had been interrupted by a technical fault.</p>
<p>A spokesman said the interruption occured around 0940 GMT and could give no details on when the system would be running properly again.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
